<.section_heading>{dgettext("landing", "What it is not")}</.section_heading>
<p class="text-sm mb-2">
  {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "It is not mIRC, and it is not an IRC network. The mIRC program cannot connect here, and there are no servers to hop between: one server, in the browser, with its own channels."
  )}
</p>
<p class="text-sm">
  {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "What it has that mIRC never did: the history is still there when you come back, private calls and file transfers run between browsers, and there are games to play in the same window."
  )}
</p>
